    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Four chapters of shapes, and the whole quality system turned out to be two fingers. Chapter 5 is next: it stops building chords and starts playing them — moving between them with the fewest fingers, crossing string sets mid-progression, and comping a whole progression. "
        },
        {
          "text": "B diminished",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " makes one more appearance there."
